### How to Run (PROPOSED INTERFACE)

```bash
# Local SAM: Single area
python scripts/compute_spsam_local.py \
  --area V1 \
  --epochs outputs/epochs_full_sequence/ \
  --tfr outputs/tfr_baseline_normalized/ \
  --lag-range -100 100 \
  --output-dir outputs/spsam_local/

# Area-aware SAM: All areas
python scripts/compute_spsam_area_aware.py \
  --epochs outputs/epochs_full_sequence/ \
  --tfr outputs/tfr_baseline_normalized/ \
  --areas V1 V2 V3d V3a V4 MT MST TEO FST FEF PFC \
  --output-dir outputs/spsam_area_aware/

# Global SAM: Full hierarchy integration
python scripts/compute_spsam_global.py \
  --spsam-local outputs/spsam_local/ \
  --coupling outputs/granger_connectivity/ \
  --output-dir outputs/spsam_global/
```

